    ],
    "text": "ONLY the Particulars relating to Kekirawa Pradeshiya Sabha in the Gazette Notice No. 2061/42-20 of Friday 09 March2018, which published the names of members elected and members returned for the Kekirawa Pradeshiya Sabha in theAdministrative District of Anuradhapura, are hereby cancelled in order to change the date of the Gazette Notice.",
