      47.85,
      435.13,
      539.9,
      459.28
    ],
    "text": "02.Accordingly, it is hereby declared that the names of the members elected and members returned for the KekirawaPradeshiya Sabha in the Anuradhapura Administrative District are specified in a Column II of the Schedule.",
